<title>USA: Inland Steel completes sale of Wabush stake.</title>
<headline>Inland Steel completes sale of Wabush stake.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inland Steel Co said Thursday it completed the sale of its 15 percent interest in Wabush Iron Ore mine to a subsidiary of Cleveland-Cliffs Inc, the mine's managing agent.</p>
<p>In a release, the company said the sale resulted in a $9 million pretax gain, or $0.11 a share, which was recognized in Inland's quarter ended June 30.</p>
<p>Inland Steel provides steel products and materials-related services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
